# The major-number registry of 1.1, c 54 from 1.3
# (docs/spec/20-module-format-and-abi.md section 6, confirmed against the
# kernels of record by M-REG1).  One line
# per number: c (character) or b (block), the major, the module that owns
# it.  The module core is built with this table (core tools/mkreg) and
# refuses a module whose .moddata majors= names a number registered to
# another module, or one not registered at all (C3-1 section 4).
c 49 z3660rtg
c 51 z3660eth
c 52 monsw
c 53 kinfo
# c 54: the Paula module (amix-paula, kabi minor 3); the static form's 53 is kinfo's
c 54 paula
# b 20: the RAM-disk module's home is amix-modules, when it is written
b 20 ramdisk
